a) 下一关 / 回小岛 (drop shadow included) keep 16 pt from the panel's inner edge (23 pt 9-slice border) on the sides
   and bottom on every phone size, 390×844 / 375×667 / 320×568 included; buttons are 128 wide on 390. Stress
   viewports under 480 pt tall (not phones) keep the previous spacing so the score stays on one page.
b) test_result_screen_style asserts the preview caption text (work/rsv2/drive.py) is absent from
   creator-build-project assets / build-templates / build-resources / settings.
c) Look-at 0.68 kept; the chest art (3D node, 2D fallback, contact shadow) moves 7 down so its visual centre is
   y 485 on 390×844 (was 478). Lid-in-frame over the whole sweep stays covered by test_result_chest_3d.
d) Outline edge: RenderTexture 1024² (was 512²) with bilinear filtering, so the up-to-900 px frame is only ever
   minified: ≈ 1 px anti-aliased edge instead of a 2 px upscale blur at dpr 3. Tested.
